  "id": "trait-rating",
  "term": "trait rating",
  "definition": "Trait rating is a research task in which participants judge how strongly a person or group is seen as having particular characteristics or traits. In this study, it was used to measure evaluations such as perceived warmth when comparing people with different levels of power.",
